# ERP Module Rules

## Where code goes

- Business pages → `src/modules/<module>/pages`
- Domain components (AccountSelector, VendorSelector, …) → `src/modules/<module>/components`
- Data fetching / API → `src/modules/<module>/services`
- Module hooks/types → `src/modules/<module>/hooks` and `src/modules/<module>/types`
- Cross-module UI → `src/components/shared`
- Primitives → `src/components/ui` (reuse only; rarely edit)

## App routes

Next.js files under `src/app/(protected-pages)` should stay thin and re-export or render module pages:

```tsx
export { default } from '@/modules/accounting/pages/Dashboard'
```

Do not dump large page implementations directly into `app/` when a module page exists or should exist.

## Navigation

When adding a module page, also register it in `src/configs/navigation.config`.
